{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20261213iHgxPx1793267644.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>公務員事務局局長楊何蓓茵等官員會見傳媒，交代就宏福苑火災報告針對公務員會採取的措施。楊何蓓茵指，當局將啟動部門首長責任制第二級調查。調查目的為涉事公務員的不足進行相應的紀律處分，將為後續的處分提供重要的依據。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:11.167671+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T09:53:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T18:58:11.413576+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T10:38:26.485145+00:00","content_hash":"a201dcb27b896f743a4861d02e4170c7e274374b391032d390df098f8a90fbc4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-29T10:42:11.167671+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}